        <activityName xml:lang="en">Data center</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Data center
The dataset contains individual components such as storage, network equipment, server, and facility. They are described in separate datasets; UUID: 04e7884e-94c2-3669-a327-b62bf43d4b7d
The dataset is based on an average of nine data centers in Switzerland and Germany. It assumes that non-infrastructure has a lifetime of 3 years, while infrastructure as a lifetime of 60 years.
Location: Global average data centers
Technology: Various components are modeled individually as modular datasets.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_04e7884e-94c2-3669-a327-b62bf43d4b7d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
